@baseUrl = http://localhost:5116
@apiKey = dev-api-key-7f3c2a9e4b1d

### 1. Obtener JWT (requiere ApiKey)
# @name token
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/token
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clientId": "facturas-client",
  "clientSecret": "dev-client-secret"
}

###
@jwt = {{token.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Lista completa de facturas (total calculado)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/facturas
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

### Facturas de un comprador por RUT (acepta 21595854-k, 21.595.854-K o 21595854)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/compradores/21595854-k/facturas
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

### Comprador con mayor monto acumulado
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/compradores/mayor-compra
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

### Compradores con monto total de compras
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/compradores
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

### Facturas agrupadas por comuna
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/facturas/comunas
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}

### Facturas de una comuna específica
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/facturas/comunas/45
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
